o inexact budget certifies rare player phi<=0.005 in any run; exact coalition completion at 1024 calls certifies phi<=0.001 and <=0.005 in every run and correctly does not certify exact zero.","Aggregate RMSE can look small while safe rare-positive elimination remains impossible; point-estimation quality and safe elimination are distinct objectives.","A candidate-targeted coalition-size marginal-stratified WoR design is the next hypothesis because its finite stratum populations are at most C(9,4)=C(9,5)=126 rather than the 10! permutation population, but that follow-up must be separately preregistered before outcomes."]}